  <h1>About Me</h1>

  <p>Hi! I’m Caitlin Bannan, a contra dance caller. I love connecting dancers with music, teaching formations, and creating fun, engaging dances for communities everywhere.</p>

  <p>In addition to calling dances, I choreograph original contra dances and maintain a growing library of dance programs and recordings.</p>

